{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#card-zh","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-loop-continue**（DSH 网页客户端插件）：当 agent 已调用过工具、随后只用文字描述下一步却没有继续调用工具时，检查这一轮的执行记录，并询问当前会话使用的模型是否还有未完成动作。判断为未完成时，它向同一轮追加续行消息，让 agent 再执行一步；普通的一步文字回答不会触发判断，已在本轮用尽续行次数或上次续行没有带来工具调用时会停止。插件还提供网页设置卡片，可调整判断提示、续行消息、步数和字符上限等选项。适合希望自动补上 agent 遗漏工具调用的 DSH 用户；额外判断会调用会话模型，依赖已配置的模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:348-440","src/client.js:613-657"]}
{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#card-en","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-loop-continue** (DSH web plugin) detects when an agent narrates an action but omits its tool call. It asks the session model whether work remains and can steer the same turn to continue, with a limit on repeated attempts. A web settings card exposes the judge prompt and steering text.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:348-440","src/client.js:613-657"]}
