{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#feature-1","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-loop-continue** 的功能「检测未完成轮次」：在 agent 停止时检查本轮步骤；仅当最后一步有文字无工具调用、此前曾调用工具时，才询问模型判断是否还承诺了未执行动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:228-233","src/index.js:378-390"]}
{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#feature-2","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-loop-continue** 的功能「续行同一轮」：判断结果为 true 时，向 agent 注入可配置的续行消息，让它再执行一步；每轮有续行上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:412-440","src/index.js:81-95"]}
{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#feature-3","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-loop-continue** 的功能「避免重复无效续行」：记录续行后的事件位置；若 agent 再次停止前没有产生工具调用，就停止继续判断，避免反复发送相同续行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:392-409"]}
