{"unit_id":"yunxiyang__dsh-loop-continue#caveat-1","repo":"yunxiyang/dsh-loop-continue","commit":"197110cf3a171e32e2d4071fe8688c0fa3a6a626","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-continue 会把当前轮次摘要交给 judge 模型判断是否仍有未完成动作；默认跟随会话的模型路由，因此实际接收方取决于当前配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:309-340","src/index.js:412-418"]}
